@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11

|Distribution Employee|
start
:Select order with completed robot sub-orders;
|System|
:Show related collection bins and order lines;
|Distribution Employee|
:Pack collected medicines into boxes;
:Enter actual number of boxes and confirm;
|System|
:Record box count and packing status;
:Make printable address label available;
|Distribution Employee|
:Print and attach address label;
if (Rush order?) then ([yes])
  :Apply rush indication to package;
else ([no])
endif
:Confirm order is ready for distribution;
|System|
:Release the packed order for dispatch;
:Make it available for separate courier scheduling;
stop
@enduml
